# Multi App Share — project rules

Read [`docs/START_HERE.md`](../../docs/START_HERE.md) and [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) every session.

## Milestone workflow

- Work from [`docs/BUILD_PLAN.md`](../../docs/BUILD_PLAN.md) labels: `[AGENT]` / `[ADB]` / `[HUMAN]` / `[AUTO]`
- Spawn **parallel subagents** only for isolated scopes in [`docs/PARALLEL_AGENT_SCOPES.md`](../../docs/PARALLEL_AGENT_SCOPES.md) when present
- After each major `[AGENT]` step: `bash scripts/watch-agent-gates.sh --once --autofix`

## Architecture

- Module boundaries: [`docs/MODULE_BOUNDARIES.md`](../../docs/MODULE_BOUNDARIES.md)
- `:core-domain` pure Kotlin only; repositories implement domain interfaces in `:core-database`
- Read-before-write: inspect `:core-domain` interfaces before editing repositories or ViewModels

## Validate before push

Never push without:

1. `./gradlew lint test detekt koverXmlReport assembleDebug`
2. `bash scripts/validate-bootstrap.sh --quick`
3. `bash scripts/feature-gate.sh --stack android`
4. Pre-release: [`docs/PRE_RELEASE_AUDIT.md`](../../docs/PRE_RELEASE_AUDIT.md) + [`docs/RELEASE_SMOKE.md`](../../docs/RELEASE_SMOKE.md)

## FOSS & limits

- No GMS, Firebase, or closed telemetry SDKs
- Composable/view files ≤ 250 lines; logic files ≤ 150 lines (`scripts/check-file-limits.ps1`)

## Production path

- Gradle root project (`app/`, `feature-dashboard/`, `core-*`) — **not** `examples/android/`
- Map: [`docs/BOOTSTRAP_TEMPLATE_MAP.md`](../../docs/BOOTSTRAP_TEMPLATE_MAP.md)

FOSS, CI, and security: see `foss-compliance.mdc`, `ci-gates.mdc`, `security-triage.mdc`.
